/P 161 0 R
/T (4.With the rapid growth of AI, digital learning, and educational technology, how can these innovations be leveraged to improve learning outcomes in rural areas while addressing challenges such as digital access, infrastructure, and teacher preparedness?)
/E (4.With the rapid growth of AI, digital learning, and educational technology, how can these innovations be leveraged to improve learning outcomes in rural areas while addressing challenges such as digital access, infrastructure, and teacher preparedness?)
