360 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 161 0 R
/E (AI should augment teachers, not replace them. It can personalise learning, reduce administrative work, and help teachers identify learning gaps early. But technology without trained educators \(ex: Atal Tinkering Lab, it is going wasted in most of the schools\), reliable infrastructure, and human connection will only widen inequality. The future of education is AI-powered and deeply human.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
