/P 163 0 R
/T (NGOs can provide grassroots support, and foster community engagement, encouraging local ownership. CSR initiatives from corporations can supplement funding, infrastructure, and technological access, bridging resource gaps. Local communities are vital for ensuring cultural relevance, participation, and sustainability. )
