423 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 167 0 R
/T (If I could change one aspect, I would strengthen the teacher ecosystem, beginning with ensuring that teachers posted in rural schools have access to government accommodation within or near the villages they serve. When teachers become part of the community rather than daily commuters, they develop a stronger sense of ownership towards the school and its students. It also encourages regular interaction with parents, builds trust within the community and improves accountability, creating a more supportive learning environment. At the same time, educational planning must be driven by accurate and regularly updated UDISE data. Reliable data enables timely teacher deployment, identifies infrastructure gaps and supports evidence-based decision-making. Together, empowered teachers and informed planning can significantly improve the quality of rural education.)
/E (If I could change one aspect, I would strengthen the teacher ecosystem, beginning with ensuring that teachers posted in rural schools have access to government accommodation within or near the villages they serve. When teachers become part of the community rather than daily commuters, they develop a stronger sense of ownership towards the school and its students. It also encourages regular interaction with parents, builds trust within the community and improves accountability, creating a more supportive learning environment. At the same time, educational planning must be driven by accurate and regularly updated UDISE data. Reliable data enables timely teacher deployment, identifies infrastructure gaps and supports evidence-based decision-making. Together, empowered teachers and informed planning can significantly improve the quality of rural education.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
