505 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 175 0 R
/T (New Delhi, July 22, 2026: The Ministry of Tribal Affairs has introduced the Medha AI digital platform across functional Eklavya Model Residential Schools \(EMRSs\) as part of a two-year programme to strengthen technology-enabled education for tribal students. The platform will support teachers in preparing lesson plans, presentations, assessments and question banks. Students will also receive personalised learning support through practice exercises, doubt-solving tools and language-learning activities. The initiative aims to make education more personalised and technology-driven, while also helping teachers improve academic planning and classroom support. The introduction of AI-enabled academic support can help improve learning opportunities for students in remote and tribal regions.)
/E (New Delhi, July 22, 2026: The Ministry of Tribal Affairs has introduced the Medha AI digital platform across functional Eklavya Model Residential Schools \(EMRSs\) as part of a two-year programme to strengthen technology-enabled education for tribal students. The platform will support teachers in preparing lesson plans, presentations, assessments and question banks. Students will also receive personalised learning support through practice exercises, doubt-solving tools and language-learning activities. The initiative aims to make education more personalised and technology-driven, while also helping teachers improve academic planning and classroom support. The introduction of AI-enabled academic support can help improve learning opportunities for students in remote and tribal regions.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
