/T (KIIT School of Rural Management \(KSRM\) under KIIT Deemed to be University, Bhubaneswar came into existence with the laying of the foundation stone jointly by Dr. Verghese Kurien, Father of the White Revolution and Prof. \(Dr.\) Achyuta Samanta, the Founder of KISS and KIIT Group of institutions on 20th November 2006. It was established to meet the professional needs of rural firms, rural development organizations, the voluntary sector, and corporations with an interest in the rural economy. KSRM works to realize its objective through teaching, training, and doing research in the field of rural management, as well as producing a new breed of professional rural managers with appropriate principles and ethos to assist organizations working to improve rural economy and development.)
/E (KIIT School of Rural Management \(KSRM\) under KIIT Deemed to be University, Bhubaneswar came into existence with the laying of the foundation stone jointly by Dr. Verghese Kurien, Father of the White Revolution and Prof. \(Dr.\) Achyuta Samanta, the Founder of KISS and KIIT Group of institutions on 20th November 2006. It was established to meet the professional needs of rural firms, rural development organizations, the voluntary sector, and corporations with an interest in the rural economy. KSRM works to realize its objective through teaching, training, and doing research in the field of rural management, as well as producing a new breed of professional rural managers with appropriate principles and ethos to assist organizations working to improve rural economy and development.)
/Pg 41 0 R
