2141 0 obj
<<
/Title (3.What role should governments, educational institutions, NGOs, CSR initiatives, and local communities play in creating a sustainable and inclusive rural education ecosystem? Where do you see the biggest gaps in collaboration today?)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2135 0 R
/First 2146 0 R
/Last 2147 0 R
/Count -2
/Next 2142 0 R
>>
endobj
2142 0 obj
<<
/Title (4.If you could introduce one transformative policy or systemic reform to strengthen India's rural education system, what would it be, and why do you believe it would have the greatest long-term impact?)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2135 0 R
/Prev 2141 0 R
/First 2148 0 R
/Last 2148 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
2143 0 obj
<<
/Title (EXPERT INTERVIEW)
